      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a profound sense of loss and despair following the collapse of your venture. Witnessing such a massive effort crumble can feel like a definitive proof of futility and overwhelming entropy. Please know that even in moments of collapse, there are always new starting points and different trajectories to explore. Recovery is rarely a straight line, but it is possible to build something new from the experience you've gained.",
