    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"start over\" thing just feels like a coping mechanism people use to stay optimistic. but if you actually look at the patterns, it's not just this one failure. it's a systemic pattern. i look at the velocity of my life and it's just accelerating towards zero. it's like there's a fundamental flaw in my architecture. how am i supposed to believe in a \"new trajectory\" when the basic math of my existence is just a downward curve?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
